     C     ORKEY         CHAIN     POR01                              60
     C     *IN60         IFEQ      '0'
     C*
     C*   PRINT THE DISTRIBUTION INFORMATION
     C*
      ***** Beg Del ***** 08/26/14 ************************************
     C**********         EXCEPT    ROUTE
      ***** End Del ***** 08/26/14 ************************************
     C                   END
     C*
