     C*
     C*   START READING THE BILLING TRANS FILE
     C*
     C     BLKEY         CHAIN     PBL01                              60
     C     *IN60         DOWEQ     '0'
     C*
     C*   PRINT THE LINE
     C*
     C   OA              EXCEPT    HEAD
     C                   MOVE      '0'           *INOA
     C*
     C*** BEGIN ADD *** 10/30/97 **************************************
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     BLPFDT        SRDTI
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DTMDY
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         XXPFDT            6 0
     C*
     C*** END   ADD *** 10/30/97 **************************************
     C*
     C                   EXCEPT    DET
