     C*
     C*  SELECTION CRITERIA NOT FOUND
     C*
     C     *IN61         IFEQ      '0'
     C                   EXCEPT    HEAD
     C                   EXCEPT    NOREC
     C                   ENDIF
     C*
     C*** END   ADD *** 10/21/97 **************************************
     C*
     C*
